@host = https://localhost:5001/api/members
@contentType = application/json
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Member Photos

GET {{host}}/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Upload Photo (multipart/form-data)

POST {{host}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profile.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Delete Photo

DELETE {{host}}/photos/photo-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

---

### Photo Upload Response Format

```json
{
  "id": "photo-guid",
  "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/your-cloud/image/upload/v1234567890/members/user-id/photo-guid.jpg",
  "publicId": "members/user-id/photo-guid"
}
```

### Photo Upload Result (from Cloudinary)

```json
{
  "url": "https://res.cloudinary.com/your-cloud/image/upload/v1234567890/members/user-id/photo-guid.jpg",
  "publicId": "members/user-id/photo-guid",
  "width": 500,
  "height": 500,
  "format": "jpg"
}
```

### Allowed File Types
- jpg, jpeg
- png
- gif
- webp

### File Size Limit
- Maximum: 10 MB (10,000,000 bytes)

### Cloudinary Transformation
- Width: 500px
- Height: 500px
- Crop: fill
- Gravity: face (auto-detects face for cropping)